      "duration": 1.9,
      "size": 30384,
      "text": "有些微分方程很难解出公式，但我们其实不必解它。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.82,
      "size": 29088,
      "text": "只要看解在平面上如何流动，就能读懂系统的命运。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.97,
      "size": 31536,
      "text": "这就是相图分析，一种用几何眼光看动力系统的方法。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "field",
      "line_id": "field-1",
      "filename": "field-field-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/field-field-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.85,
      "size": 45648,
      "text": "把状态画成平面上的点，方程 x撇 等于 A x 就给每个点指定一个速度箭头。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "field",
      "line_id": "field-2",
      "filename": "field-field-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/field-field-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.19,
      "size": 34992,
      "text": "所有箭头汇成一片向量场，像水面的暗流指引着运动方向。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "field",
      "line_id": "field-3",
      "filename": "field-field-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/field-field-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.14,
      "size": 34272,
      "text": "顺着箭头走，就描出一条轨线，也就是系统真实的演化路径。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "equil",
      "line_id": "eq-1",
      "filename": "equil-eq-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/equil-eq-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.08,
      "size": 33264,
      "text": "有一个特殊的点，速度恰好为零，那里的状态永不改变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "equil",
      "line_id": "eq-2",
      "filename": "equil-eq-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/equil-eq-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.73,
      "size": 27648,
      "text": "它就是平衡点，对线性系统来说正是原点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "equil",
      "line_id": "eq-3",
      "filename": "equil-eq-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/equil-eq-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.4,
      "size": 38448,
      "text": "附近的轨线是被它吸引还是被它推开，决定了系统稳定与否。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "classify",
      "line_id": "cls-1",
      "filename": "classify-cls-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/classify-cls-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.08,
      "size": 33264,
      "text": "矩阵 A 的特征值揭示一切：由迹与行列式就能判断。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "classify",
      "line_id": "cls-2",
      "filename": "classify-cls-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/classify-cls-2.mp3",
      "duration": 1.65,
      "size": 26352,
      "text": "两个同号实特征值是结点，一正一负是鞍点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "classify",
      "line_id": "cls-3",
      "filename": "classify-cls-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/phase-portrait/yunxi/classify-cls-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.67,
      "size": 42768,
      "text": "共轭复特征值让轨线打转，实部不为零是焦点，纯虚数则是中心。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "phase-portrait",
      "section_id": "interaction",
